# Backup Rules (3 Rules)

## 19. Rollback Ready
Options: Vercel Instant Rollback or redeploy a previous deployment.

## 20. Sanity Export
Export weekly via GitHub Actions. Before schema changes. On every release.

## 21. Single Backup Location
ALL backups in ONE S3 bucket.
